  "slug": "maple-balsamic-vinaigrette",
  "name": "Maple-Balsamic Vinaigrette",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "This balsamic and maple vinaigrette dressing with Dijon mustard is delicious on chicken or shrimp salads. Also doubles as a marinade for pork!",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Place vinegar, maple syrup, Dijon mustard, salt, and pepper into a blender. Turn the blender on; pour in olive oil in a slow, steady stream. Blend until salad dressing is smooth and emulsified, 10 to 15 seconds."
    }
  ],
